1
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 18=

3
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,400
Ye Shen.

4
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,880
I told you to wait for me.

5
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,080
Why did you leave on your own?

6
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,440
When did you ask me to wait?

7
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,400
In the last class.

8
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,680
- That math problem...
- Xiaotang!

9
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:04,080
Ye Shen! Wait for me!

10
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,240
Xiaotang, we haven't walked home
together in ages.

11
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,240
Let's go together.

12
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,240
- Sure.
- No.

13
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,040
I need Ye Shen urgently.

14
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,040
We're heading out.

15
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,720
Hurry.

16
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,200
She didn't follow us?

17
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,840
What... what on earth is going on?

18
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,520
Aren't you two best friends?

19
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,760
Why the sudden change of attitude?

20
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,600
At this point,

21
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,520
I have no choice but to tell you.

22
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:43,880
The truth is,

23
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,640
I can see the future.

24
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:50,160
There you go again.

25
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:51,160
I'm serious.

26
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:54,000
Not only will Xia Na stop
being my best friend,

27
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,200
she'll also steal my fiance,

28
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,120
making me the biggest laughingstock.

29
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,760
She... she'll even get me killed.

30
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,600
Gu Xiaotang,

31
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:04,760
it's a shame you're not writing novels
with that imagination.

32
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,760
You don't believe me?

33
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,080
Then let me predict something

34
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,080
about you.

35
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:11,600
Me?

36
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,600
Ye Shen,

37
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,120
I'm telling you honestly,

38
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:16,280
if you give up on drawing,

39
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,480
you'll become
a very cold person in the future

40
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:22,040
who's miserable every single day.

41
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:23,880
Think about it. Isn't that terrifying?

42
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,800
But my dream isn't to be an artist.

43
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,760
I just like to draw.

44
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,800
Then... then what's your regret?

45
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,040
R-Regret?

46
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:38,760
Isn't there anything
you look forward to in the future?

47
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,600
Actually,

48
00:02:41,880 --> 00:02:43,880
I don't care much about the future.

49
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:48,240
I think the future
is like a variable equation.

50
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:51,200
Every decision you make now
changes the outcome.

51
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,000
Instead of worrying about that,

52
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,200
it's better to focus on now.

53
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,960
So, what do you want to do now?

54
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:00,640
Now?

55
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:03,400
Maybe.

56
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,400
What is it? Tell me.

57
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,760
It's...

58
00:03:09,920 --> 00:03:11,360
Come on, just tell me.

59
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,520
I... I actually...

60
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,520
Gu Xiaotang.

61
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:16,120
I heard Lin Wei say
they're going to corner Xia Na.

62
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,440
They're on their way now.

63
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,440
What?

64
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:29,080
(Why would Xiaotang treat me like this?)

65
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,560
(What exactly did I do wrong?)

66
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,800
Xia Na.

67
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:42,800
What? Dumped by your best friend?

68
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,680
Putting on a sad show all by yourself?

69
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,000
Lin Wei, what do you want?

70
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Move!

71
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:50,160
You gave Gu Xiaotang that recording,

72
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:52,320
and she used it to blackmail my family.

73
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:54,480
My dad beat me because of it.

74
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,720
This is all your fault!

75
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:59,800
No, that's impossible.
Xiaotang would never do that.

76
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,000
She wouldn't?

77
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,480
Birds of a feather

78
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:05,600
flock together.

79
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,400
Don't you know that?

80
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:10,440
Wei, why waste your breath
on this trash?

81
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,960
Let's teach her a lesson.

82
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:12,960
Yeah.

83
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,480
Such a pretty face.

84
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,480
Wake up.

85
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,480
Gu Xiaotang could sell you
down the river,

86
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,840
and you'd thank her for the ride.

87
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:23,440
You brought this on yourself.

88
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,800
Na!

89
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,200
Na!

90
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:34,280
Na!

91
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:36,880
Na...

92
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,400
Na! Na!

93
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,120
Xia Na, what happened to you?

94
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,320
Who did this?

95
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,560
Na, how come...

96
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,000
Was it Lin Wei's gang?

97
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,000
Tell me. I'll go...

98
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:58,200
Gu Xiaotang, stop pretending to care.

99
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,480
Who are you fooling with those tears?

100
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,360
Na, what are you talking about?

101
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:05,280
How much did you
sell me out for this time?

102
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,760
Watching them humiliate me like this,

103
00:05:08,760 --> 00:05:10,080
are you satisfied?

104
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,200
Happy with your spoils?

105
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,200
That's not true.

106
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,680
Na,

107
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,800
was it Lin Wei?

108
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,840
What did she tell you?

109
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,240
She's getting between us.

110
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,240
That so?

111
00:05:20,400 --> 00:05:21,840
They told me everything.

112
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:23,760
The recording. I gave you the recording.

113
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,960
But you give it to your dad
to blackmail her family.

114
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,320
I was such a fool.

115
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:31,000
I thought you were my best friend.

116
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,880
I didn't, Na.

117
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,640
I didn't do it.

118
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,680
- Enough!
- It was Lin...

119
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,960
I don't want to hear
any more of your excuses.

120
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,760
Get out of my sight.

121
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:44,640
It was Lin Wei.

122
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:45,720
She must be behind this.

123
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,600
She twisted the truth.

124
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,840
I'm going to find her.

125
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:49,840
Xiaotang!

126
00:05:51,440 --> 00:05:53,800
That was so satisfying.

127
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:55,320
That'll teach her.

128
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,400
I've never liked her.

129
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,480
She's not even a fraction of you, Wei.

130
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:00,480
Stop it.

131
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,800
Did you hurt Xia Na?

132
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,160
Now you're standing up for your bestie?

133
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,200
I was just about to find you.

134
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,960
And you brought yourself to me.

135
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,440
Did you turn her against me?

136
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,960
Turn her against you?

137
00:06:18,640 --> 00:06:19,800
Did I say anything wrong?

138
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,920
You're the one who tossed Xia Na aside,

139
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:25,440
always hanging around with some guy.

140
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,760
- Xiaotang!
- What are you doing?

141
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:30,480
- Don't.
- You wretch, you want to fight?

142
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,800
Who are you insulting?

143
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:36,200
Say it again!

144
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,560
Ye Shen!

145
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:39,520
- Say it again! I dare you!
- Ye Shen!

146
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:40,520
Say it again!

147
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:42,960
Since when did my place become a zoo?

148
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,440
Ms. Lei.

149
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:48,400
Ms. Lei, you're just in time.

150
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:49,920
It's Gu Xiaotang's fault.

151
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,680
She came here to cause trouble,

152
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,960
and even tried to hit me.

153
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,120
Ms. Lei, teach her a lesson quickly.

154
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,560
Ms. Lei?

155
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:23,160
Why... why did you hit me?

156
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:26,760
I hit you
because you bullied classmates,

157
00:07:26,760 --> 00:07:27,880
picked on the weak,

158
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,400
and stirred up drama.

159
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,200
Apologize to her.

160
00:07:33,320 --> 00:07:35,600
But Ms. Lei, she was the one
who started it!

161
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:38,800
Lin Wei, just apologize to her.

162
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,920
I'm giving you a way out.

163
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,840
Don't push your luck.

164
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:48,000
Or do you want me
to do this by the rules?

165
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:50,800
Hurry up.

166
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,400
Sorry.

167
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:03,400
Louder.

168
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,760
You haven't eaten?

169
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,040
I can't hear you.

170
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,720
Gu Xiaotang,

171
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:12,040
I'm sorry.

172
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:13,880
I-I was wrong.

173
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,400
Get lost.

174
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,360
Let's go.

175
00:08:34,047 --> 00:08:35,308
(30 Buyers Receive
Over 1.3 Million in Compensation)

176
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:42,320
A serious accident happened
at Red Star Textile Factory.

177
00:08:42,680 --> 00:08:45,360
Pool hall owner evacuated the crowd
before disaster struck

178
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:46,640
and was hailed as a hero.

179
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:48,520
Did you all hear that?

180
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:50,960
From today on,

181
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:54,000
Gu Xiaotang is my business partner.

182
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,760
She's to be treated like me.

183
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,000
Call her Ms. Xiaotang.

184
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,960
- Ms. Xiaotang.
- Ms. Xiaotang.

185
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,840
Xiaotang, you're incredible.

186
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:14,120
Everything you predicted came true.

187
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:17,120
The factory made their gesture?

188
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,720
I didn't feel right taking that money.

189
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:24,160
Besides, I have principles.

190
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,600
No shady money.

191
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:29,520
And with a big shot like you on my side,

192
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,760
making money's not the problem.

193
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:34,280
If you get any more leads,
you come to me.

194
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,600
You have principles and standards.

195
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,360
I do know a way

196
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:43,160
to wealth.

197
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,280
(Xiaotang,)

198
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:49,360
do you know how my family got rich?

199
00:09:50,920 --> 00:09:51,920
Stop drinking.

200
00:09:51,920 --> 00:09:52,920
I'm fine.

201
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:55,680
It was all thanks to my dad's foresight.

202
00:09:56,400 --> 00:10:00,320
Back then, Red Star Steel
couldn't pay its workers,

203
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:04,400
so they paid them
internal shares instead.

204
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:08,600
Those were basically worthless papers.

205
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:12,480
My dad went door to door,
buying them all up for dirt cheap.

206
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:16,880
Later, when Red Star Steel went public,

207
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:20,520
those worthless papers
skyrocketed in value.

208
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,480
What do you call that?

209
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:28,760
Destiny.

210
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:36,960
(The Lu family rose to power
on insider knowledge)

211
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:38,520
(and then trampled over everyone else.)

212
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,960
(I can't let them have
such a chance in this life.)

213
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:44,320
(Ms. Lei may run in the underworld,)

214
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,520
(but she plays by the rules.)

215
00:10:45,520 --> 00:10:46,800
(Helping her rise)

216
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:49,480
(is way better
than letting Lu Qingyuan get rich.)

217
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:54,680
Xiaotang, why are you smiling?

218
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:58,440
Stop holding out on me. Spill it.

219
00:10:58,640 --> 00:10:59,640
I do have a way.

220
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:03,080
It just depends on
whether you have the guts

221
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:04,720
and the appetite for it.

222
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:07,600
Ms. Lei, don't listen to her nonsense.

223
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,240
Nobody asked you.

224
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,480
Get lost.

225
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,080
Go buy up Red Star Steel's
internal shares

226
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,560
right now.

227
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:22,960
Use cash to drive the price down
to 60 or 70 percent of face value.

228
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:25,440
Buy as much as you can
get your hands on.

229
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:28,400
You'll be rolling in it
before you know it.

230
00:12:04,313 --> 00:12:07,669
♪The face deep in the heart♪

231
00:12:07,861 --> 00:12:10,323
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

232
00:12:11,698 --> 00:12:15,398
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

233
00:12:15,609 --> 00:12:18,049
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

234
00:12:18,196 --> 00:12:20,568
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

235
00:12:20,718 --> 00:12:23,475
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

236
00:12:23,475 --> 00:12:25,796
♪Even for just a second♪

237
00:12:27,141 --> 00:12:30,604
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

238
00:12:30,732 --> 00:12:32,581
♪And sunlight reverses♪

239
00:12:32,581 --> 00:12:36,051
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

240
00:12:36,407 --> 00:12:38,481
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

241
00:12:38,983 --> 00:12:42,392
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

242
00:12:42,649 --> 00:12:47,861
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

243
00:12:49,115 --> 00:12:51,680
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

244
00:12:51,722 --> 00:12:55,175
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

245
00:12:55,752 --> 00:12:58,715
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

246
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:02,068
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

247
00:13:02,068 --> 00:13:05,691
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

248
00:13:06,161 --> 00:13:10,217
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
